// std.r1_release_acceptance - R1 release-acceptance fixture.
//
// Director disposition for R1C-D closes R1 with two strict PB gates green
// (`pb_self_compile_fixed_point`, `pb_compiler_std_ratchet_zero`) and four
// PB census gates structurally deferred to R3 authority. The deferral claims
// use `R3DeferredClaim` only because the Director explicitly approved this
// release-acceptance fixture shape; do not copy it into arbitrary suites.

